    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ENM302 · Assessment 1/8</span>\n<h2>Assignment 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13252 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ENM302 · Đầu điểm 1/8</span>\n<h2>Assignment 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13252 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">10.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">On-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLOs 1, 3, 6, 10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Groupwork and role play: Form groups and perform a role-play simulating a typical day in an international business office.<br>• Each student takes on a role (e.g., manager, client, team member, HR officer).<br>• Engage in tasks such as conducting meetings, negotiating, handling conflicts, and giving presentations.<br>• A 10-minute recorded video of the role-play.<br>• A reflection report (300–500 words) explaining the communication strategies used and their relevance.<br>• Suggested AI Tools:<br>• ChatGPT for script drafting and scenario brainstorming.<br>• Speechling or Elsa Speak for pronunciation and fluency practice.<br>• Canva for Education for visual aids in presentations.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Knowledge and skills in studied unit(s): Unit 6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Students work in groups</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 48 — Assignment 2</li><li>Session 49 — Assignment 2 (Cont)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 48 — Assignment 2</li><li>Buổi 49 — Assignment 2 (Cont)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
